{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Lead [B]me, [Cm]Lord, [Ab/C]lead [Fm/Ab]me [Cm]in [Eb/Bb]Thy [Bb]righteousness;
[Cm]Make Thy [Ab]way plain [Eb/Bb]before [Bb]my [Eb]face.
[Eb/G]For [Bb7/F]itis [Eb/G]Thou, Lord, Thou, [Ab/C]Lord [Eb/Bb]only,
[Gm]That [Cm/Eb]makest me [Ab]dwellinsafe [Bb]ty.
{end_of_verse}
